sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Usuario (Terminal)
    participant CLI as CLI (clap)
    participant Router as EmailClient (Router)
    participant ImapAdapt as IMAP Backend Adapter
    participant ImapLib as io-imap (Librería)
    participant Server as Servidor IMAP

    User->>CLI: himalaya envelope list
    CLI->>Router: list_envelopes("INBOX", page=1)
    Router->>ImapAdapt: list_envelopes(...)
    ImapAdapt->>Server: SELECT "INBOX"
    Server-->>ImapAdapt: OK (EXISTS=100)
    Note over ImapAdapt: Calcula ventana local: 91:100
    ImapAdapt->>Server: FETCH 91:100 (UID FLAGS ENVELOPE RFC822.SIZE)
    Server-->>ImapAdapt: Raw IMAP responses
    ImapAdapt->>ImapAdapt: envelope_from() → Vec[Envelope]
    ImapAdapt-->>Router: Vec[Envelope]
    Router-->>CLI: Vec[Envelope]
    CLI-->>User: Tabla en consola (stdout)
    Note over User,Server: Conexión cerrada. Proceso termina.
